{"type":"Film","id":"FR2015_129","slug":"fr2015-129-l-etudiante-et-monsieur-henri","title":{"native":"L'Étudiante et Monsieur Henri","english":"The Student and Mr. Henri"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2015-10-07","year":2015},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Ivan Calbérac","slug":"ivan-calberac","name":"Ivan Calbérac","birthYear":1970,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/104/76/150632/format_page/l-etudiante-et-monsieur-henri.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Dnh1zXBV3iM"},"synopsis":{"native":"À cause de sa santé vacillante, Monsieur Henri ne peut plus vivre seul dans son appartement parisien. Particulièrement bougon, il finit néanmoins par accepter la proposition de son fils Paul de louer une chambre à une jeune étudiante. Loin de tomber sous le charme, Henri va se servir d'elle pour créer un véritable chaos familial…","english":"Because of his failing health, Monsieur Henri can no longer live alone in his Parisian apartment. Particuliarly grouchy, he nevertheless ends up accepting his son's proposal that he rent out a room in the apartment to a student. Far from succumbing to the young woman's charms, Henri makes use of her to create genuine chaos in his family..."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"}],"characters":[{"id":"FR2015_129_01","film":"FR2015_129","person":{"id":"Claude Brasseur","slug":"claude-brasseur","name":"Claude Brasseur","birthYear":1936,"deathYear":2020,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"age":"4: Fourth Age (>75)","gender":"Male identifying","sexuality":"Heterosexual","origin":"White Western European","class":"Middle class","profession":"Retired","ability":"Chronic illness","assistedMobility":"No"}],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Claude Brasseur","slug":"claude-brasseur","name":"Claude Brasseur","birthYear":1936,"deathYear":202